[{"text":"GSD[p] can be used as input for a D-dimensional \\(p^\\mu \\gamma_\\mu\\) and is transformed into DiracGamma[Momentum[p,D],D] by FeynCalcInternal (=FCI).","anchor":"gsd"},{"text":"GSD[p,q, ...] is a short form for GSD[p].GSD[q].","anchor":"gsd"},{"text":"Overview, DiracGamma, GA, GAD.","anchor":"see-also","section":"See also"},{"text":"GSD[p]","anchor":"cb1","section":"Examples"},{"text":"\\[\\gamma \\cdot p\\]","anchor":"cb1-1","section":"Examples"},{"text":"GSD[p] // FCI // StandardForm (*DiracGamma[Momentum[p, D], D]*)","anchor":"cb2","section":"Examples"},{"text":"GSD[p, q, r, s]","anchor":"cb3","section":"Examples"},{"text":"\\[(\\gamma \\cdot p).(\\gamma \\cdot q).(\\gamma \\cdot r).(\\gamma \\cdot s)\\]","anchor":"cb3-1","section":"Examples"},{"text":"GSD[p, q, r, s] // StandardForm (*GSD[p] . GSD[q] . GSD[r] . GSD[s]*)","anchor":"cb4","section":"Examples"},{"text":"GSD[q] . (GSD[p] + m) . GSD[q]","anchor":"cb5","section":"Examples"},{"text":"\\[(\\gamma \\cdot q).(m+\\gamma \\cdot p).(\\gamma \\cdot q)\\]","anchor":"cb5-1","section":"Examples"}]